From 88c7da7fc4043182ed851e46956af9ef44fe4875 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Mar 2026 11:11:24 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 21/98] feat(feishu): renew streaming_mode every 8 min to
 prevent Feishu 10-min timeout

Feishu auto-closes streaming_mode 10 minutes after the last open call.
Add renewStreamingMode() which re-enables streaming_mode via card.settings
at 8-minute intervals during active streaming sessions. Sequence is only
advanced on success to avoid holes on failure. Tests cover all branches.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 extensions/feishu/src/streaming-card.test.ts | 101 ++++++++++++++++++-
 extensions/feishu/src/streaming-card.ts      |  39 ++++++-
 2 files changed, 138 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

